":"Olmsted kept walkers, riders and carriages on separate levels so they never had to cross. It is the same idea as a motorway junction, invented for a park in the 1870s."}},{"id":"0e3e4df6-05b4-4615-b78e-e68bfd88689f","createdAt":1786942184815,"transform":{"position":[-30,-0.5803837814776838,-72],"rotation":[0,0.35,0],"scale":[1,1,1]},"kind":"preset-prop","prop":"park-pavilion","options":{}},{"id":"993aea1a-0592-4842-844c-626f3f72bd32","createdAt":1786942184816,"transform":{"position":[-26,-0.8979226858574116,-54],"rotation":[0,0,0],"scale":[1,1,1]},"kind":"preset-prop","prop":"stone-steps","options":{"steps":7,"width":9}},{"id":"fbc0100c-4f74-4128-93c4-f75bb2afb3a1","createdAt":1786942184817,"transform":{"position":[-20,-1.06932681798933,-55],"rotation":[0,-0.9,0],"scale":[1,1,1]},"kind":"preset-prop","prop":"info-placard","options":{"eyebrow":"The Overlook","title":"Reading a landscape","body":"Almost nothing here is accidental. Trees were planted to frame some views and hide others, and the ground was reshaped so the park feels bigger than it is."}},{"id":"176695be-4c26-4449-a0d3-d8903519c956","createdAt":1786942184819,"transform":{"position":[40,-0.010265121297075464,6],"rotation":[0,0,0],"scale":[1,1,1]},"kind":"preset-prop","prop":"playground","options":{}},{"id":"9a6972ba-184b-4dfe-a3d7-d5c11f1980b1","createdAt":1786942184820,"transform":{"position":[14,-8.881784197001252e-16,4],"rotation":[0,-0.5,0],"scale":[1,1,1]},"kind":"preset-prop","prop":"info-placard","options":{"eyebrow":"The playground","title":"Swings are physics","body":"A swing is a pendulum. Its rhythm depends on the length of the chain, not on how heavy you are — which is why the long swings feel slower than the short ones."}},{"id":"90c53aea-55b9-43a5-a6a5-27bef8058834","createdAt":1786942184822,"transform":{"position":[58,0.3634168895341032,-44],"rotation":[0,-1.1,0],"scale":[1,1,1]},"kind":"preset-prop","prop":"ball-field","options":{"baseline":30}},{"id":"db8d682d-db81-4367-947d-ee9474d4ec